  - m_Id: 962012897280
    m_Localized: "Karas testified that he returned home from work as usual. Upon
      arriving, he found the room locked and empty. \nAfter noticing the trashed
      kitchen, he grew worried and checked Sophie's room, where he found her dead.
      \nMoments later, he attacked Mary when she returned to the apartment."
